@startuml F7.8-D04-reset-senha-admin
title F7.8-D04 — Reset de senha administrativo
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
autonumber

actor "Admin" as Admin
participant "WebApp" as WebApp
participant "JwtFilter" as Jwt
participant "IAMController" as Ctrl
participant "ResetPasswordAdminUseCase" as UC
database "Postgres" as Postgres

Admin -> WebApp: Confirmar envio
WebApp -> Jwt: POST /admin/usuarios/{id}/reset-senha
Jwt -> Ctrl: JWT ok
Ctrl -> UC: execute(...)
UC -> Postgres: outbox link JWT\n+ audit_log
note right of UC
  admin não vê senha/link
end note
Postgres --> UC: OK (COMMIT)
UC --> WebApp: 200
WebApp --> Admin: banner Link enviado

@enduml
